### Pipeline de qualite
```bash
vendor/bin/phpstan analyse          # Analyse statique
vendor/bin/php-cs-fixer fix         # Fix code style
vendor/bin/phpunit                  # Tests
vendor/bin/phpunit --coverage-html  # Coverage
composer quality                    # Full check
```

